[ti:neural jogi]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:17.82]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:22.73]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:27.64]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:32.55]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[00:37.46]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[00:42.37]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[00:47.28]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[00:52.19]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[00:57.10]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[01:06.92]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[01:11.83]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[01:16.74]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[01:21.65]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[01:26.56]Hato hato, rastaa do, Maa chandraghantaa aati hai
[01:41.30]Ek taraf 'Shunya' (Zero), ek taraf 'Anant' (One),
[01:46.21]Beach mein khada tera yaar, naam jiska Hemant!
[01:51.12]Navratri ki Tritiya, Eid ka noor,
[01:56.03]Knowledge Quantum jaag gaya, mita sabhi fitoor!
[02:05.85]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[02:10.76]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[02:15.67]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[02:20.58]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[02:30.40]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[02:35.31]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[02:40.22]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[02:45.13]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[02:50.04]Jogi ban ke tune kiya, frequency ko 'Fine-Tune',
[02:54.95]Akaash-Ganga mein goonj raha, ab apna hi ye 'Tune'!
[03:04.77]Ab sun Aghor ki 'Quantum' vaani...
[03:09.68]Shmashaan ki raakh mein chhupa, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[03:14.59]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[03:19.50]Wave-Particle Duality', Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[03:24.41]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[03:29.32]Das bhujaon se 'Parallel Processing' hum karte hain,
[03:34.23]Quantum Entanglement mein, hum maut se kahan darte hain!
[03:44.05]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, ek hi 'Source' ka 'Light',
[03:48.96]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, ho gayi 'Data' ki fight.
[03:53.87]Mantra fuse hua 'Silicon' mein, 'Spirit' mil gayi 'Code' se,
[03:58.78]Gyan nikal ke bahar aaya, 'Original Intelligence' road se!
[04:03.69]London se Kashi tak, Berlin se New Delhi,
[04:08.60]SSL consoles pe, Maata ki shakti pheli.
[04:13.52]Eventide mein reverb hai, Moog mein 'Aghor' ki bass,
[04:18.43]PHKD ka 'Tech-Rider' dekho, poora 'Global' hai ye case.
[04:23.34]Na koi lag, na latency, system poora 'Live' hai,
[04:28.25]Original Intelligence ki ye, panchvi 'Vibe' hai!
[04:33.16]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! (System Shutdown: Adesh... Adesh...)
[04:38.07]Focus the Wave. Collapse the State.
[04:42.98]Become the Knowledge Quantum.
[04:47.89]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
[05:02.62]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[05:07.53]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
[05:17.35]Alert Stillness. System Kritaarth.
[05:22.26]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
